<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n101486" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συστρᾰτ-εύω</span></b> , more freq. in 
			Med.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συστρᾰτ-εύομαι</span></b> :—
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>join</i> or <i>share in
				an expedition</i>, abs., <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.44
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				9.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.99
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.56
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				3.5.16
			</span></i> (
				Act.
			), etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span>
			<i>with</i> another, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				9.106
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				3.5.5
			</span></i> (
				Act.
			), etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετά τινων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					2.29
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				80
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σὺν βασιλεῖ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					2.4.36
				</span></i>
			 (
				Med.
			).--<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
			</span></i> always uses it in 
				Med.
			, as also <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				<u>R.</u>
				468b
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				471d
			</span></i>); <i><span class="en">
				Th.
			</span></i> prefers 
				Act.
			, but also uses 
				Med.
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1.99
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.12
			</span></i>, al., with <i><span class="en">
				2.56
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				80
			</span></i>, al.; <i><span class="en">
				X.
			</span></i> has both, but more freq. 
				Med.
			, as also <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				20.29
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
